# ImageMagick native precision resources

ImageMagick is credited to ImageMagick Studio LLC and the original contributors named in its source and license. The local C interface/cache transport is part of the surrounding project; it does not replace those authorships.

The complete Core license is in licenses/ImageMagick.txt. The official delegate bootstrap is described in DEPENDENCIES-SBOM.json; its license texts are retained under licenses/dependencies. The bootstrap inventory contains24 components and is distinct from the exact libraries linked by the build recipe.

Compiler/runtime notices are retained under licenses/toolchain for Emscripten, musl, libc++ and libc++abi. The recorded toolchain release and source revisions are in native/magick-native/TOOLCHAIN.json.

