The exact source repositories/commits are retained in DEPENDENCY-SOURCE-REFS.json and the pinned Dependencies source archive. The local reconstruction uses the declared official bootstrap; it does not assert a local rebuild of all those libraries.

No image, ICC test profile, user data, installation configuration or application installer is included in this resource/source directory.
